OL,3,GNEWSALong delays after M6 overnight
OL,4,Aroadworks overrun
OL,5,
OL,6,FDelays of an hour have been reported
OL,7,Ffollowing the closure of part of the M6
OL,8,Fafter overnight roadworks overran,
OL,9,FNational Highways said.
OL,11,FThe northbound stretch in Staffordshire
OL,12,Fbetween junction 11 for Shareshill,
OL,13,Fnorth of Wolverhampton, and junction 12
OL,14,Ffor Gailey remained shut, it stated on
OL,15,FWednesday morning.
OL,17,FNational Highways said the overrunning
OL,18,Froadworks were due to issues with
OL,19,Ftarmac supply and broken down
OL,20,Fmachinery.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
